    <h1>The Shopify Store Kit</h1>
    <p class="sub">Everything you decide on paper before you open a store — the niche, the setup, the supplier, the words. Four PDFs — three instant, one for your email.</p>
    <div class="hero-meta">
      <span>4 PDFs</span>
      <span class="b"></span>
