  <div class="shell">
    <aside class="rail-left"></aside>

    <article class="article">

      <p class="lede first">A store that sells a real object — a mug, a tote, a nursery print — used to need a garage of stock, a warehouse, and your face on the account. It needs none of those now.</p>

      <p>What it needs is the thinking done first: who you're selling to, which supplier makes it, how the store is set up, and the words on the page. That's what these four do. Print on demand means nothing is made until it's paid for, so a wrong guess costs you an afternoon, not a pallet.</p>

      <p>Everything here is free. Three download the moment you click; the Niche Vault unlocks with your email. Each PDF carries the exact Shopify sign-up link, so the day you're ready, the door is one tap away.</p>

      <div class="box check">
        <div class="tag"><span class="g">✦</span> What's inside — four PDFs</div>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>The Store Niche Vault</strong> — 30 money-making niches, sorted by why they actually sell: identity, gifting, and the dates that come back every year.</li>
          <li><strong>The Weekend Store Setup Checklist</strong> — the six Shopify settings that matter and the ten that don't yet, so you finish in an afternoon.</li>
          <li><strong>The POD &amp; Dropshipping Vendor Guide</strong> — which app for which product, and the one rule that keeps a store alive: US-warehoused only.</li>
          <li><strong>The AI Prompt Pack</strong> — 20 prompts for finding the niche, writing the product page, naming the brand, and staging the photo.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="box action">
        <div class="tag"><span class="g">✦</span> Yours free</div>
        <h2>Download the kit</h2>
        <p>Three are instant — no email. The fourth, The Store Niche Vault (the full 30-niche list), unlocks the second you drop your email, right here on the page.</p>
        <p style="margin:16px 0 8px"><a class="btn" href="/shopify-setup-checklist.pdf" download>The Weekend Setup Checklist <span class="a">→</span></a></p>
        <p style="margin:8px 0"><a class="btn" href="/shopify-vendor-guide.pdf" download>The Vendor &amp; App Guide <span class="a">→</span></a></p>
        <p style="margin:8px 0 0"><a class="btn" href="/shopify-ai-prompt-pack.pdf" download>The AI Prompt Pack <span class="a">→</span></a></p>

        <div class="nv-gate" style="margin-top:24px;padding-top:22px;border-top:1px solid rgba(43,22,27,.13)">
          <iframe name="nv-sink" title="Signup response" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true" style="position:absolute;width:0;height:0;border:0;visibility:hidden"></iframe>
          <form id="nv-form" action="https://assets.mailerlite.com/jsonp/2532349/forms/193994333796435364/subscribe" method="post" target="nv-sink">
            <p style="margin:0 0 12px"><strong>🎯 The Store Niche Vault — 30 money-making niches.</strong> Enter your email and it unlocks below:</p>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap">
              <input type="email" name="fields[email]" placeholder="your@email.com" aria-label="Email" required autocomplete="email" style="flex:1 1 240px;padding:13px 16px;border:1px solid var(--gray);border-radius:2px;font-size:15px;font-family:inherit;background:#fff" />
              <button class="btn" type="submit" style="border:none;cursor:pointer">Send me the Niche Vault <span class="a">→</span></button>
            </div>
            <input type="hidden" name="ml-submit" value="1" />
            <input type="hidden" name="anticsrf" value="true" />
          </form>
          <div id="nv-done" hidden>
            <p style="margin:0 0 10px">You're in — it's on its way to your inbox. Grab it right here too:</p>
            <p style="margin:0"><a class="btn" id="nv-link" href="/shopify-niche-vault.pdf" download>Download The Store Niche Vault <span class="a">→</span></a></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <script is:inline>
