          var sink=document.getElementsByName('nv-sink')[0]; var sent=false;
          f.addEventListener('submit',function(){ sent=true; var b=f.querySelector('button'); if(b){b.disabled=true;b.textContent='Sending…';} });
          sink.addEventListener('load',function(){
            if(!sent) return;
            f.style.display='none';
            var d=document.getElementById('nv-done'); if(d) d.hidden=false;
            if(window.fbq) fbq('track','Lead');
            try{ var t=document.createElement('a'); t.href='/shopify-niche-vault.pdf'; t.download=''; document.body.appendChild(t); t.click(); t.remove(); }catch(e){}
          });
        })();
      </script>

      <div class="box tip">
        <div class="tag"><span class="g">✦</span> Open the store for a dollar</div>
        <p>Every one of these points at the same door. New Shopify stores get a 3-day free trial, then $1 a month for the first three months on the Basic plan — Shopify's offer, and it can change, so read the screen when you sign up.</p>
        <p>Not in the US? Shopify works anywhere — you set your own shipping zones, so you can sell to just your own country and skip the customs mess, and the intro price runs in your local currency (read the screen).</p>
        <p style="margin-bottom:0"><a class="btn" href="https://shopify.pxf.io/eK3xYz" rel="sponsored noopener">Start your Shopify store <span class="a">→</span></a></p>
        <p style="font-size:12px;color:var(--choc-meta);margin-top:14px;margin-bottom:0">Affiliate link — The Digital Income Edit™ may earn a commission if you start a store, at no cost to you.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="deeper">
        <span>The full build —</span>
        <a href="https://www.skool.com/thedigitalincomeedit/classroom/886389d5" rel="noopener">The Shopify Edit walks the whole store — niche to first ten sales, print on demand and dropshipping — lesson by lesson inside the membership →</a>
      </div>

      <div class="rule"><span class="d"></span></div>

      <div class="chapter reveal">
        <div class="num">Going further</div>
        <div class="orn"><span class="d"></span></div>
        <h2>When you want the turn-by-turn</h2>
      </div>

      <p>These four are the paper part. The Shopify Edit is the build — seventeen lessons that open the store, connect the supplier app, write the product page, place the test order, and find the first ten buyers where they already ask.</p>

      <p>It's inside Standard membership at $9/mo, alongside the rest of the library. Different questions, different doors — pick the one that matches yours.</p>

      <p style="margin-bottom:44px"><a class="btn" href="/membership" rel="noopener">See the Membership <span class="a">→</span></a></p>

